__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.swp
*.tmp

# Every sound this plugin plays is generated by bin/make-battle-audio and
# committed, including the looping theme, so a fresh clone fights with sound
# and with nothing in it that anybody else wrote.
#
# Music you supply yourself does not live here at all. It lives outside the
# checkout, in ~/.config/omarchy/hyprbattles/assets/, where git cannot see
# it however large it is and whatever its licence says - see
# lib/battle_assets.py and `bin/hyprbattles-ctl assets`. This entry is what is
# left of the old arrangement: whatever a theme was decoded from used to be
# kept next to the asset, and a source file that predates the move is still
# ignored rather than suddenly staged.
assets/*.source.*
